From d66ac95d0fc7e79e27d075b9a563a697f6226726 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:01:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sylo): Console home, Account section pages, loader/error
 kit

- /vault is now the Sylo Console (widgets); Vault Hub removed, /vault/hub redirects
- Account split into /vault/account/:section/:view (entity|local|kyc|game x
  home|dashboard|analysis|management), lazy-loaded views
- Legacy /vault?tab=... shim (lib/sylo-routes.ts) + sidebar/dock/search updated
- Extract EntityManager from pages/user/vault.tsx to components/sylo; drop dead
  helpers; support ?new=1
- Add components/console kit: skeletons, loaders, error pages, QueryBoundary,
  ConfirmDialog, PageHeader, StatTile, Widget, EmptyState
- Replace fake-progress VaultLoadingIntro with VaultLoading; route-level
  ErrorBoundary; real 404 page
- Tests: sylo-routes (new), module-nav (updated); regenerate frontend-registry
